{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":214500,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":9302.506870000001,"text":"Im Jahr 1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensand zur Liste der gefährdeten Weltkulturerbegebiete hinzugefügt."},{"kind":"text","t":9764.563667,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of endangered World Heritage sites due to the threat from desert sand."},{"kind":"audio","t":9818.55837,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9819.987411,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9821.689412,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9823.503883000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":9825.355249,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9827.099173,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":21418.956543,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film Das Vermächtnis der Tempelritter gesehen haben, denken Sie vielleicht, dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte gezeichnet wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":21931.394365999997,"text":"If you’ve watched the movie “The Templar Legacy,” you might think that a treasure map was drawn on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":21986.630857999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21988.581774,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21990.14057,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21991.976302,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21993.77569,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21995.553526,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21996.46,"samples":22392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"input","t":34358.306418,"text":"Kinder werden aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien untergebracht, und zwar aus verschiedenen Gründen, die von Vernachlässigung über Missbrauch bis hin zur Erpressung reichen."},{"kind":"text","t":34676.316776,"text":"Children are placed in foster families for a variety of reasons, ranging from neglect and abuse to coercion."},{"kind":"audio","t":34726.458662000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":34727.877938000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34729.596805,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":34731.30173,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34733.09549,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":34734.555597,"samples":29960,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":45134.18353,"text":"Das Cochamo-Tal Chiles wichtigstes Kletterziel, bekannt als der Josemite National Park von Südamerika mit einer Vielzahl von großen Granitwänden und Klippen."},{"kind":"text","t":45607.316414,"text":"The Cochamo Valley is Chile’s most important climbing destination, known as South America’s version of Yosemite National Park, featuring numerous large granite walls and cliffs."},{"kind":"audio","t":45663.605932,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45665.488014,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":45666.990315,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45668.709612,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45670.661479,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45672.387647,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45674.214266,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45676.087364,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45677.938189,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":45678.106142000004,"samples":9888,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":52152.523672,"text":"Aristoteles' Ansichten zu allen Wissenschaftsfragen einschließlich der Psychologie waren anerkannt."},{"kind":"text","t":52439.656944,"text":"Aristotle's views on all scientific matters, including psychology, were recognized."},{"kind":"audio","t":52489.133289000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52490.603251,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52492.375818,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52494.194906000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52495.477205,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":62519.53358,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie achtsam. Steiles Gefälle, enge Fahrbahnen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen hier."},{"kind":"text","t":62816.721833,"text":"If you’re not used to driving on country roads, stay cautious. Steep slopes, narrow roads, and sharp turns predominate here."},{"kind":"audio","t":62861.482832,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62863.264684,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":62865.442851,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":62865.711546,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":62914.558914,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62916.398262,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62918.186533,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":62918.315347,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":75558.470428,"text":"Die Gegenwart eines echten, unsichtbaren Teams, Larson und LaFasto, 1989, Seite 109."},{"kind":"text","t":75972.60723200001,"text":"The presence of a real, invisible team, Larson and LaFasto, 1989, page 109."},{"kind":"audio","t":76020.92877900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76022.498301,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":76024.190096,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76025.944376,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76027.72741,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76029.243772,"samples":30560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":77707.850804,"text":"ist auch ein einzigartiger Bestandteil eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"text","t":77898.84914800001,"text":"It is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"audio","t":77945.70676100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77947.44339500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77949.015901,"samples":32264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":90750.532247,"text":"Nach dem Unfall wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus gebracht. Er verstarb jedoch kurz darauf."},{"kind":"text","t":91004.65085800001,"text":"After the accident, Gibson was taken to a hospital. He passed away shortly thereafter."},{"kind":"audio","t":91052.731401,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":91054.839213,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91056.891502,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":91057.00338000001,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":91091.879423,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91093.635987,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":91093.736638,"samples":4664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":101129.072226,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren beinhalten außerdem Mandeln, Haselnüsse oder andere Nüsse. Beliebte Kuchen passen häufig besonders gut zu einer Tasse starken Kaffees."},{"kind":"text","t":101450.949603,"text":"Many German baked goods also contain almonds, hazelnuts, or other nuts. Popular cakes often pair especially well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":101495.54096700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101497.147645,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101498.942335,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101500.81932,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":101500.95232,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":101532.386304,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":101534.084629,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101535.928304,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101537.28565600001,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":107836.337717,"text":"Wenn man eine romanische Sprache spricht, ist es natürlich leichter, Portugiesisch zu erlernen."},{"kind":"text","t":108084.080162,"text":"If one speaks a Romance language, it’s naturally easier to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"audio","t":108128.32891,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108129.99026,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":108131.673002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":108133.511919,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":108133.672191,"samples":7528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":116365.10829,"text":"Die Klang- und Lichtshow bei den Pyramiden ist eine der interessantesten Attraktionen für Kinder in der Gegend."},{"kind":"text","t":116711.279566,"text":"The sound and light show at the pyramids is one of the most interesting attractions for children in the area."},{"kind":"audio","t":116756.99039400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116758.592745,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116760.262758,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":116762.128035,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":116763.917158,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":116764.198221,"samples":11960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":127102.08831800001,"text":"Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten und der Interaktionen, die zwischen beiden stattfinden."},{"kind":"text","t":127476.229314,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and the interactions that occur between them."},{"kind":"audio","t":127526.299031,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":127528.02852400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127529.876405,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127531.669012,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127533.48813,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":127535.35005200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127537.27482800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":900},{"kind":"audio","t":127537.370202,"samples":4024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":138033.549811,"text":"Der Australier Mitchell Gurley wurde 11. im stehenden Super-G der Männer. Der tschechische Konkurrent Aldrich Jelinek wurde 16. im sitzenden Super-G der Männer."},{"kind":"text","t":138379.08535,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gurley became the 11th. Men's standing Super-G. The Czech competitor Aldrich Jelinek finished in 16th place. Men's sitting Super-G."},{"kind":"audio","t":138421.572016,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":138423.120397,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138424.101823,"samples":23264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"audio","t":138467.529135,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138469.096484,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138470.943002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138472.91398800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":138474.252432,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":540},{"kind":"audio","t":138500.609766,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":138501.457903,"samples":20632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":330},{"kind":"input","t":151286.910135,"text":"Das Haitianische Institut für Gerechtigkeit und Demokratie hat auf unabhängigen Studien verwiesen, die nahelegen, dass das nepalesische UN-Friedensbataillon die Krankheit unwissentlich nach Haiti eingeschleppt hat."},{"kind":"text","t":151727.47611,"text":"The Haitian Institute for Justice and Democracy cited independent studies suggesting that the Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion inadvertently brought the disease to Haiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":151782.77027,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151784.467233,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":151786.277117,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151788.171478,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":151790.048783,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151791.926449,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151793.759888,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":151795.594148,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":151797.497963,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":151797.794159,"samples":11088,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":159363.586664,"text":"Bald nach dem Ausbruch von Kampfhandlungen initiierte Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland."},{"kind":"text","t":159643.438178,"text":"Shortly after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain imposed a naval blockade on Germany."},{"kind":"audio","t":159687.979216,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159689.663611,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":159691.419853,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159693.312542,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159694.589443,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":167796.818095,"text":"Er griff auch alles an, was ins Wasser kam. Selbst ein großer Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex war ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"text","t":168131.92961700002,"text":"He also attacked anything that went into the water. Even a giant dinosaur like the T-Rex wasn’t a match for him."},{"kind":"audio","t":168172.612379,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168174.284125,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168175.569669,"samples":26864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"audio","t":168210.433113,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168212.24635200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168214.00575,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":168214.579563,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":179368.833175,"text":"Die Verwendung von Videoaufzeichnungen führte zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen für die Deutung von Mikroexpressionen, wenige Millisekunden dauernden Gesichtsbewegungen."},{"kind":"text","t":179749.322024,"text":"The use of video recordings led to important insights for interpreting microexpressions, facial movements that last just a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"audio","t":179799.630501,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179801.302387,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179803.068705,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179804.93921,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179806.699929,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179808.604906,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179810.513768,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179811.100391,"samples":15424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":189583.28099,"text":"Die Ankündigung erfolgte nach einem Telefongespräch von Trump mit dem türkischen Präsidenten Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"text","t":189891.43597700002,"text":"The announcement came after a phone call between Trump and Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"audio","t":189937.18336,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189938.676277,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189940.488574,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189942.198828,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189943.844124,"samples":32728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":199992.116189,"text":"Es gibt Familienstrände, die manchmal überlaufen sind, mit einer schönen Einkaufspromenade entlang der Küste, das Schwimmen ist hier sicher."},{"kind":"text","t":200384.592297,"text":"There are family beaches that can be crowded at times, with a nice promenade along the coast; swimming here is safe."},{"kind":"audio","t":200430.624479,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200432.391998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200434.161541,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200436.009492,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200436.926722,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"audio","t":200463.630187,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200464.219474,"samples":17632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":212901.378797,"text":"Die meisten der kleineren Inseln sind unabhängige Nationen oder zu Frankreich gehörig und als luxuriöse Seebäder."},{"kind":"text","t":213215.450899,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or part of France and serve as luxurious seaside resorts."},{"kind":"audio","t":213262.372128,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":213263.912887,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213265.661258,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213267.447916,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213269.289408,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":213270.904037,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"close","t":224502.915664,"code":1005}]}